# Server-side PostHog capture of activation milestones (first DID, first credential, first agent, first status
# list). Off unless POSTHOG_API_KEY is set. Uses the customer id (a UUID) as the distinct id and sends only
# allow-listed event names and properties (never email, name, DID, key or claim). EU cloud, no session replay.
# The key is a secret: set it in the environment, never in a file that is committed.
# POSTHOG_API_KEY=""
# POSTHOG_HOST="https://eu.i.posthog.com"

# Staff analytics: comma-separated plan (role) names counted as paid in plan mix and the delete guard
# PAID_PLAN_NAMES="build"

